            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the explanation!\n\n> ... and I could easily just \"work around\" this by just... not editing the buffer, ...\n\nYeah, that would have been the easiest approach for both sides :)\n\nA single error would have been probably fine, but the infinite loop is definitely not good. The loop part is probably only a 'mini.notify' issue, but handling 'modifiable' is something that is better be addressed for all modules. I'll take a look.",
